SplitMind patch 0016 for OpenConnector v1.9.2 (after 0001-0005 and 0009-0015).
Upstream issue: not filed yet.
Email watch: #125 stale abort after a success, stub cursors for names that never started, migration 0023, sweep ordering, quieter alias-change warn.
From bd279717b4e23e71b56095669d046730dac615b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SplitMind <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:41:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(email-watch): stale-abort guard, stub cursors, sweep
 ordering (#125)

Stale abort after a success leaves no item; a name whose first get_profile
fails gets a stub cursor and a 'could not start reading' item after 24 hours;
migration 0023 adds cursor created_at; a failed items purge skips the cursor
purge; the alias-change warn only when rows were dropped.
